# Without fairness on the rebind, a moved alias or a changed definition can
# leave the view stale forever.
MODULE: ConvergesCutoverRebindUnfair
TARGET: Converges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the rebuild a cutover or a changed definition requires is never guaranteed to run

--- FIND
     /\ WF_vars(Apply) /\ WF_vars(ApplyBatch)
     /\ WF_vars(Rebind)
--- REPLACE
     /\ WF_vars(Apply) /\ WF_vars(ApplyBatch)
--- END
